  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SIWI-Chemical Management India, 2012-13 - SIWI-Chemical Management India, 2013-14</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SIWI-Chemical Management India, 2013-2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida collaborates with SIWI, KappAhl, Lindex and Indiska in order to reduce the use of water, energy and chemicals in the indian textile and   leather industry. The objective of the projedct is to implement Swedish Textile Water Ininitiative guidelines for sustainable water   and chemical management in 39 textile factories and industries.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida samarbetar med SIWI KappAhl, Lindex och Indiska f&#xf6;r att minska vatten-, energi- och kemikalienav&#xe4;ndningen i textilindustrin i Indien. Syftet  &#xe4;r att implementera Swedish Textile Water Initiative&apos;s riktlinjer f&#xf6;r h&#xe5;llbar vattenanv&#xe4;ndning i textilindustrin hos 39 textil-producenter.  Insatsen finansieras 2013 av 15512 (Indien) och 2014 fr&#xe5;n konto      15471 (ENICT)</narrative>
  </description>
